#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "On the search page, open the <b>Comments</b> tab to search what people wrote in comments (a guild's own search has it too). Words, \"phrases\" and <code>-words</code> are looked for in the comment's text. These operators work on comments: <code>%(from_op)s</code>, <code>%(in_op)s</code> (where the comment is: its post's guild, topic or curation), <code>%(since)s</code>, <code>%(until)s</code>, <code>%(after)s</code>, <code>%(before)s</code>, <code>%(on)s</code>, <code>%(min_votes)s</code>, <code>%(is_ai)s</code> and <code>%(is_partnership)s</code>. The ones about a post's own content (<code>%(has)s</code>, <code>%(lang)s</code>, <code>%(domain)s</code>, <code>%(url)s</code>, <code>%(flair)s</code>, <code>%(is_forward)s</code>, <code>%(min_comments)s</code>) are left out with a note."
msgstr "Sa pahina ng paghahanap, buksan ang <b>Mga Komento</b> task upang hanapin kung ano ang isinulat ng mga tao sa mga komento (ang sariling paghahanap ng isang samahan ay mayroon din nito). Mga salita, \"mga salita\" at <code>-words</code> ay hinahanap sa teksto ng komento. Ang mga opereytor na ito ay gumagawa ng mga komento: <code>%(from_op)s</code>, <code>%(in_op)s</code> (Kung saan ang komento ay: ang samahan ng post nito, paksa o citated feed), <code>%(since)s</code>, <code>%(until)s</code>, <code>%(after)s</code>, <code>%(before)s</code>, <code>%(on)s</code>, <code>%(min_votes)s</code>, <code>%(is_ai)s</code> at <code>%(is_partnership)s</code>. Mga tungkol sa sariling nilalaman ng isang post (mga larawan ng isang post)<code>%(has)s</code>, <code>%(lang)s</code>, <code>%(domain)s</code>, <code>%(url)s</code>, <code>%(flair)s</code>, <code>%(is_forward)s</code>, <code>%(min_comments)s</code>) ay iniiwan na may nota."

