msgstr "Upang lumikha ng isang \"bahagi sa %(site)s\" na buton, lumikha ng isang elemento na may `onclick=\"window.location.href='https://ruqqus.com/submit?url='+window.location.href\"`"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "To help protect user privacy and safety, %(site)s forces HTTPS on all assets uploaded and submitted to %(site)s. This includes automatic conversion of all \"http://\" schemas into \"https://\"."
msgstr "Upang mapangalagaan ang pribadong buhay at kaligtasan ng gumagamit nito, ang %(site)s ay naglalagay ng HTTPS sa lahat ng asset na naka-download at isinumite sa %(site)s. Kasama rito ang awtomatikong pagkumberte sa lahat ng \"http://\" schemas tungo sa \"https://\"."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "To indicate the presence of a %(site)s-powered embed of content from %(site)s."
